wanted the current solar reading and asked Ivo to check the generation meter or inverter display and reply with the kWh figure; a screen photo was offered as an alternative.","attachments":[]},{"number":7,"timestamp":"2025-09-03 13:05:00 UTC","channel":"Update","from":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","to":"Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)","body":"Maya noted that this appeared to be an information request rather than maintenance and moved it to manual handling. No contractor was selected.","attachments":[]},{"number":8,"timestamp":"2025-09-03 13:20:00 UTC","channel":"Note","from":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","to":"Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)","body":"Set a three-business-day follow-up for a tenant response.","attachments":[]},{"number":9,"timestamp":"2025-09-08 10:15:00 UTC","channel":"Update","from":"Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)","to":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","body":"The follow-up period expired. No tenant reply was visible in this request's correspondence.","attachments":[]},{"number":10,"timestamp":"2025-09-09 09:40:00 UTC","channel":"Email","from":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","to":"Ivo Mercer (Tenant)","body":"Maya followed up, repeating the request for the current generation reading or a photo of the meter/inverter display.","attachments":[]},{"number":11,"timestamp":"2025-09-09 09:52:00 UTC","channel":"Note","from":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","to":"Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)","body":"Recorded that the team was waiting a further three business days for the tenant's response.","attachments":[]},{"number":12,"timestamp":"2025-09-14 10:05:00 UTC","channel":"Update","from":"Northbridge Lettings workflow (System)","to":"Maya Chen (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)","body":"The follow-up period expired; no reply was visible against this request.","attachments":[]},{"number":13,"timestamp":"2025-09-14 10: